notes:        Assembly workspace: the Project panel with the Footage, Audio, Graphics and Sequences bins, Ocean_Sunset.mp4 loaded in the Source monitor, the Program monitor on the graded dunes frame, and the demo sequence on the timeline. 1600x900. Every frame shown is FilmSweet's own procedurally generated demo media (crates/media/src/generators.rs); contains no third-party, Adobe or copyrighted footage. All UI icons are drawn in code; fonts are Inter and JetBrains Mono (OFL-1.1).
